          ],
          "confidence": "low",
          "interpretation_level": "disputed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "why_it_matters",
      "title": "Reading the Chapter Carefully",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_6",
          "text": "The chapter\u2019s prayer for rulers seeks a quiet and dignified life, so it should not be converted into ruler worship, sacral nationalism, militarism, or partisan loyalty. Likewise, its language of ransom and proclamation cannot justify forced conversion, cultural erasure, colonial mission, or religious violence.",
